  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Arcforge Players Compendium</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When negotiating with a creature summoned through a (calling) spell or with the Call Planar Creature advanced Conjuration talent, you may have it serve you for twice the normal duration that would normally be allowed or agreed upon. In addition, if that specific outsider ever crosses you again after its service has ended, you gain a +2 bonus on saving throws against its abilities.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/conjuration#toc125\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
